# Values scripts/check-structure.sh accepts although their class would reject
# them: `<class> <value>`, one per line, each with its reason. An email value
# without an `@` admits that domain and its subdomains. The list grows only when
# the gate fires on something that belongs in the tree.
email n1cck.radio                  # the project's own sending domain
email nick@n1cck.us                # the published maintainer contact
email n1cck@onlyhams.radio         # a commit author address, seeded once from the history
email martin.donath@squidfunk.com  # the licence attribution NOTICE must carry
